abstract: "AI Business Core (AIBC) is the AI adoption and governance framework created by VREINN (framework lead: Alien Martínez); GROU LLC holds the rights and publishes it. This repository explains the framework and holds its deterministic, rules-based engine, which matches an organization profile against the applicability conditions of a knowledge base. Reference information, not legal advice."
